## BUILD ORDER — FOLLOW THIS EXACTLY

### ════ STAGE 1: BACKEND ════

**STEP 1.1 — Foundation**
```
□ Copy doc/.env.example → .env.local, fill in dev values
□ Run: npx prisma migrate dev (schema from spec)
□ Copy doc/seed.ts → prisma/seed.ts
□ Run: npx ts-node prisma/seed.ts
□ Verify: 64 tables created, 41 permissions seeded, fixture users exist
□ GATE: prisma studio opens — all tables visible with seed data ✓
```

**STEP 1.2 — Shared Infrastructure**
```
□ src/lib/prisma.ts      — singleton Prisma client
□ src/lib/redis.ts       — cache (DB 0) + queue (DB 1) Redis clients
□ src/lib/errors.ts      — ApiError class + all 30 error codes
□ src/lib/response.ts    — success/error/paginated envelope builders
□ src/middleware/errorHandler.ts  — global error handler (Zod, Prisma, ApiError)
□ src/middleware/authenticate.ts  — JWT RS256 verify, actor context injection
□ src/middleware/validate.ts      — Zod middleware factory
□ src/middleware/rateLimit.ts     — Redis sliding window rate limiter
□ src/queues/index.ts    — all 8 BullMQ queues instantiated
□ src/lib/eventBus.ts    — domain event router
□ GATE: POST /api/v1/health returns 200 ✓
```

**STEP 1.3 — Modules (in this exact order)**

For EACH module below:
1. Read the relevant context file from `vsp_cursor_context_pack/`
2. Read `00_ARCHITECTURE.md` alongside it
3. Generate: validator → repository → service → controller → routes
4. Write unit tests for the service layer
5. Run integration tests before moving to next module

```
□ Module 01: auth          (context: 01_auth.md)
  GATE: POST /auth/register + /auth/login + /auth/refresh all pass ✓
  GATE: JWT RS256, refresh token hashed, token rotation works ✓

□ Module 02: users         (context: 02_users.md)
  GATE: GET/PATCH /users/me, saved-workers, follows all pass ✓

□ Module 03: worker-profiles (context: 03_worker_profiles.md)
  GATE: Full onboarding flow — create profile through submit verification ✓
  GATE: Aggregate fields (avgRating, jobsCompleted) are DERIVED — never writable ✓

□ Setup BullMQ workers     (context: X3_background_jobs.md)
  GATE: All 8 queues running, job_runs table logging correctly ✓

□ Module 04: search        (context: 04_search.md)
  GATE: Typesense workers collection created, worker indexed on approval ✓
  GATE: GET /search/workers?lat=5.6&lng=-0.2 returns ranked results ✓

□ Module 05: social        (context: 05_social.md)
  GATE: Create post, feed loads, like/save/comment all work ✓

□ Module 06: chat          (context: 06_chat.md)
  GATE: Message persisted to DB before any broadcast ✓
  GATE: GET /conversations/:id/messages paginates correctly ✓

□ Module 07+08: requests + bookings (context: 07_08_requests_bookings.md)
  GATE: Full flow — request → matched → accepted → booking created ✓
  GATE: Booking conflict detection (30-min buffer) works ✓
  GATE: State machine blocks invalid transitions ✓

□ Module 09+10+11: reviews + moderation + notifications
  GATE: Review eligibility guard (booking must be COMPLETED, within 168h) ✓
  GATE: Notification created in DB regardless of delivery success ✓
  GATE: Fraud signal thresholds trigger moderation case ✓

□ Module 12+13+14+15: billing + support + analytics + admin
  (context: 12_13_14_15_billing_support_analytics_admin_v2.md)
  GATE: All 65 admin endpoints work, PERMISSION_DENIED returned correctly ✓
  GATE: Dangerous actions (USER_SUSPEND, WORKER_VERIFY) require mfa_verified=true ✓
  GATE: Admin audit log written on every dangerous action ✓

□ WebSocket Gateway        (context: X1_websocket_gateway.md)
  GATE: Connect, join conversation, send message, receive broadcast ✓
  GATE: Presence tracked in Redis with 45s TTL ✓
  GATE: Notification fan-out delivers to connected user via WS ✓

□ Media Pipeline           (context: X2_media_pipeline.md)
  GATE: POST /media/upload-url returns signed URL ✓
  GATE: POST /media/confirm enqueues image_process job ✓
  GATE: ClamAV scan runs before processing ✓
```

**STEP 1.4 — Backend Verification**
```
□ Run full integration test suite
□ Run migration tests on clean DB
□ Run RLS policy tests
□ Check: all 195 endpoints return correct status codes for valid + invalid input
□ Check: rate limiting blocks at correct thresholds
□ Check: audit_integrity_check job repairs avgRating drift correctly
□ GATE: 80%+ service layer coverage ✓
□ GATE: Zero 500 errors on smoke test suite ✓
□ GATE: All fixture IDs from seed.ts resolve correctly in tests ✓
```

