### Backend → Admin Frontend
```
□ All 195 endpoints respond correctly to valid requests
□ All error codes return correct HTTP status + envelope
□ Seed data loads cleanly on empty DB
□ Background jobs run without errors for 24h
□ WebSocket connects, sends message, delivers notification
□ Rate limiting tested (auth endpoints, search, messages)
```

### Admin Frontend → Web Frontend
```
□ All 48 admin pages render without console errors
□ Login → dashboard → verify worker → moderation case — full flow works
□ Permission guards block unauthorized access correctly
□ MFA setup and challenge flow works end-to-end
□ All tables show real data from backend
□ Badge colours match design system exactly
```

### Web Frontend → Mobile Frontend
```
□ All 45 pages render without console errors
□ Guest → Register → Worker Onboarding → Verification submit — full flow works
□ Customer → Create Request → Accept by worker → Complete booking → Review — full flow
□ WebSocket chat works between two browser tabs
□ Infinite scroll loads pages correctly, stops at hasNext=false
□ Auth token refresh works transparently (access token expires, request retries)
```

### Mobile → Done
```
□ All 41 screens render on iOS simulator and Android emulator
□ Auth flow works on both platforms
□ Push notifications received on both platforms
□ Offline state handled gracefully (no crash, retry on reconnect)
□ Keyboard avoiding works on all form screens
□ FlatList performance: no dropped frames on feed scroll
```

